  "stem": "If \\(\\frac{2x + 1}{5} = x - 4\\), what is the value of \\(x\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "7"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Multiply both sides by 5: \\(2x + 1 = 5x - 20\\).",
    "Subtract \\(2x\\) and add 20: \\(21 = 3x\\).",
    "So \\(x = 7\\)."
  ],
